        'mapEmbedUrl' => 'https://www.google.com/maps?q=Mount+Horeb+WI&output=embed',
        'neighbors' => ['verona', 'cross-plains', 'middleton', 'fitchburg', 'belleville', 'madison'],
        'intro' => 'Mount Horeb is an easy run southwest out US 151 past Verona, and it\'s hard to mistake for anywhere else once you arrive: Main Street is the Trollway, lined with the carved wooden trolls that gave the village its Troll Capital nickname, with the Duluth Trading flagship holding down the middle of it and the Military Ridge State Trail passing the old depot. We\'ve completed 26 jobs in Mount Horeb since 2021, spread from the village core to the newer neighborhoods on the edges.',
        'localNotes' => [
            'The village sits up on the ridge the old Military Ridge road followed, right where the Driftless hills start rolling, and the housing splits the usual small-town way: older homes around Main Street and the downtown blocks, many with detached garages carrying decades-old hardware, and newer subdivisions pushing out toward the ridge edges with attached garages and builder-grade openers that all went in around the same time and are all aging on the same clock. Skiers headed to Tyrol Basin drive past both kinds all winter.',
            'We\'re not a call center with a map. Twins Garage Doors is a family company run by twin brothers out of our Madison shop, and Mount Horeb is part of the regular route down the 151 corridor. There\'s a good chance we\'ve already worked on a door on your street.',
            'Ridge-top living has a winter tax. Mount Horeb sits high enough that the wind hits doors here harder than it hits a sheltered Madison subdivision, driving cold through uninsulated panels and finding every gap in an old seal. The hills add the second problem: sloped driveways shed meltwater across the apron on every thaw afternoon, and the overnight refreeze locks the bottom seal to the concrete. Then someone hits the button, the opener strains against a frozen door, and a cheap seal problem becomes a stripped gear. If your door sticks on cold mornings, that\'s the sequence we\'re interrupting, and catching it at the seal stage is by far the cheapest version.',
        ],
        'faq' => [
            ['q' => 'How much does it cost to repair a garage door in Mount Horeb?', 'a' => 'Most spring replacements land between $575 and $1,225 for the complete job, cable repairs between $325 and $625, and minor opener repairs between $100 and $300. Those ranges come from our own completed local jobs, including 26 in Mount Horeb since 2021. You approve a flat quote first.'],
            ['q' => 'How quickly can a technician get to Mount Horeb?', 'a' => 'Same-day in most cases. Mount Horeb is an easy run out US 151 past Verona from our Madison shop. Call (608) 420-2377, tell us what the door is doing, and we\'ll give you an honest arrival window instead of a number we invented.'],
            ['q' => 'How important is an insulated garage door in Mount Horeb?', 'a' => 'More important than in most towns we serve. Mount Horeb sits up on the ridge, and wind exposure pulls heat through an uninsulated door fast. An insulated Clopay door protects the car, anything stored inside, and any room over the garage. Most new doors we install here are insulated steel.'],
            ['q' => 'What are the most common garage door issues in Mount Horeb homes?', 'a' => 'Broken springs first, then doors frozen to the slab where sloped driveways refreeze overnight, then opener sensors knocked out of line. The village\'s older detached garages also bring worn rollers and tracks that have never been serviced. A $49 tune-up catches most of it early.'],
            ['q' => 'Do I need to replace both springs if only one is broken?', 'a' => 'Usually yes, and it saves you money. Both springs have cycled the same number of times, so the survivor is close behind. Replacing the pair in one visit costs far less than two separate spring calls, which is part of why our $575 to $1,225 range covers the whole ticket.'],
        ],
    ],
    'deerfield' => [
