        'intro' => 'Belleville straddles the Sugar River where Highway 69 drops south out of the Madison metro, with Lake Belle View at the middle of town and a downtown that famously throws a UFO Day festival every fall. We get there the direct way, down through Verona on Highway 69, and the village pairs naturally with our Oregon and Evansville stops.',
