            ['q' => 'How quickly can a technician get to Cross Plains?', 'a' => 'Same-day in most cases. Cross Plains sits on the US 14 corridor we run through Middleton, so it folds into the daily route easily. Call (608) 420-2377 and we\'ll give you an honest arrival window for the day.'],
            ['q' => 'My door freezes to the floor on a hillside driveway. What fixes that?', 'a' => 'Meltwater running down the apron re-freezes under the door overnight. A fresh bottom seal, a threshold check, and correct closing force usually end it. Never force the opener through ice; that\'s how gears strip and bottom panels bend.'],
            ['q' => 'Can I replace a garage door spring myself?', 'a' => 'No, and we say that as people who encourage DIY lubrication. Springs hold hundreds of pounds of tension and injure people every year. With the $0 service call with repair, professional diagnosis costs nothing, and the full spring job runs $575 to $1,225.'],
